flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase scoped memory approval and revocation
  accDescr: A proposed lesson carries origin and scope but remains excluded from future context. The owner reviews a displayed version, approval commits with a revision check, and only later explicit runs pin it. Revocation or deletion excludes it from later runs without rewriting earlier context.
  Proposal["Proposed lesson with origin and scope"]
  Excluded["Excluded from future context"]
  Review["Owner edits or reviews displayed version"]
  Commit["Approval commits with revision check"]
  Snapshot["Later explicit run pins approved version"]
  Revoke["Revoke or delete for later runs"]
  Proposal --> Excluded
  Proposal --> Review
  Review --> Commit
  Commit --> Snapshot
  Commit --> Revoke
  Revoke --> Excluded
